1
00:00:00,808 --> 00:00:03,638
(Raj:)Stuart's dressed like a
brother of the Night's Watch,

2
00:00:03,644 --> 00:00:05,474
(Raj:)and they don't have sex.

3
00:00:05,479 --> 00:00:06,479
(Howard:)There you go.
That's true.

4
00:00:06,480 --> 00:00:07,710
(Sheldon:)Fair enough.

5
00:00:08,950 --> 00:00:10,110
(Bernadette:)Hey.

6
00:00:10,111 --> 00:00:11,311
(Bernadette:)Hey.
You all right?

7
00:00:11,816 --> 00:00:13,346
(Howard:)I'm fine.

8
00:00:13,351 --> 00:00:15,881
(Howard:)Just a little embarrassed I had
to be carried down the stairs

9
00:00:15,886 --> 00:00:16,956
(Howard:)like a baby.

10
00:00:16,954 --> 00:00:18,484
(Stuart:)Thanks.

11
00:00:20,324 --> 00:00:22,124
(Leonard:)Let's get out of here.

12
00:00:22,126 --> 00:00:23,656
(Amy:)That was scary.

13
00:00:23,661 --> 00:00:25,061
(Sheldon:)Well, the
important thing is

14
00:00:25,062 --> 00:00:27,092
(Sheldon:)I said that big sandwich
would ruin everything,

15
00:00:27,098 --> 00:00:28,928
(Sheldon:)and I was right.

16
00:00:32,169 --> 00:00:35,269
KOOTHRAPPALI:
Hey, Jon Snow!

17
00:00:35,272 --> 00:00:38,512
(Raj(shouting from upstairs window):)How come your horse
has a basket on it?

18
00:00:40,277 --> 00:00:43,747
(Stuart:)How come your head
has your face on it?

19
00:00:45,816 --> 00:00:48,416
(Sheldon:)They don't wear bicycle helmets
in Game of Thrones.

20
00:00:48,419 --> 00:00:50,489
(Sheldon:)You're thematically inaccurate,

21
00:00:50,487 --> 00:00:54,187
(Sheldon:)but I applaud
your commitment to safety.

22
00:00:54,191 --> 00:00:57,221
(Stuart:)Don't you guys have anything
better to do?

23
00:00:57,227 --> 00:00:59,597
(Leonard:)Better than watching
a guy in a fur cloak

24
00:00:59,596 --> 00:01:02,966
(Leonard:)ride a girl's
bike? Nope.

